        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Worldview Entertainment\n- Products: Child 44, Birdman, Blood Ties, The Green Inferno, Killer Joe\n- People: Daniel Espinosa, Richard Price, Tom Rob Smith\n- Topics: independent film production, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Worldview Entertainment is an American independent motion picture company that finances and produces theatrical-quality feature films for worldwide distribution.\n- Worldview Entertainment has produced the films Birdman, Blood Ties, The Green Inferno, Killer Joe, and Child 44.\n- Tom Rob Smith wrote the 2008 novel Child 44.\n- Child 44 is a 2015 mystery thriller film directed by Daniel Espinosa and written by Richard Price.\n- The 2015 film Child 44 is based on Tom Rob Smith's 2008 novel of the same name.",
